      en: ["Commissioned in 1612 by Marie de' Medici, inspired by the Boboli Gardens.", "The park covers a total land area of approximately 23 hectares.", "The Luxembourg Palace has been the seat of the French Senate since 1958.", "Home to over 100 statues, including the renowned 'Queens of France' series.", "The Medici Fountain was built around 1630 and later moved to its current site.", "Features a historic orangery and a famous apiary established in 1856."],
